* PM28 bench 'railshort': 5 V rail shorted 2.5-3.5 ms, 3.3 V rail shorted 4.0-5.0 ms, full load otherwise
* Generated by sim/run.py from calc/sizing.json. Edit there, not here.
.include models.lib
.lib LTC4364-2.sub
.lib LT8641.sub
.lib LTC3.lib
.lib standard.mos
.lib standard.dio
VB VBUS 0 28
VEN ENOUT 0 PWL(0 0 50u 5)
* ---- 5V0 buck (LT8641, 1 MHz, FCM + spread spectrum)
XU5 V5 INT5 BST5 VBUS NC5a 0 NC5b SW5 NC5c 0 NC5d NC5e VBUS ENOUT RT5 SS5 INT5 0 PG5 FB5 LT8641
CIA5 VBUS 0 1e-06 Rser=5m
CIB5 VBUS 0 1e-06 Rser=5m
CIC5 VBUS 0 4.7e-06 Rser=5m
CBST5 BST5 SW5 0.1u
CINT5 INT5 0 1u
RRT5 RT5 0 41200
CSS5 SS5 0 4.7e-09
L5 SW5 V5 4.7u Rser=37m
CO5A V5 0 1.3e-05 Rser=3m
CO5B V5 0 1.3e-05 Rser=3m
* ^ 22 uF 10 V X7R 1210, modelled at its capacitance under DC bias
RFT5 V5 FB5 777000
RFB5 FB5 0 150000
CFF5 V5 FB5 2.2e-11
RPG5 PG5 V3 100k
* ---- 3V3 buck (LT8641, 1 MHz, FCM + spread spectrum)
XU3 V3 INT3 BST3 VBUS NC3a 0 NC3b SW3 NC3c 0 NC3d NC3e VBUS ENOUT RT3 SS3 INT3 0 PG3 FB3 LT8641
CIA3 VBUS 0 1e-06 Rser=5m
CIB3 VBUS 0 1e-06 Rser=5m
CIC3 VBUS 0 4.7e-06 Rser=5m
CBST3 BST3 SW3 0.1u
CINT3 INT3 0 1u
RRT3 RT3 0 41200
CSS3 SS3 0 4.7e-09
L3 SW3 V3 4.7u Rser=37m
CO3A V3 0 1.5e-05 Rser=3m
CO3B V3 0 1.5e-05 Rser=3m
* ^ 22 uF 10 V X7R 1210, modelled at its capacitance under DC bias
RFT3 V3 FB3 505000
RFB3 FB3 0 164000
CFF3 V3 FB3 2.2e-11
RPG3 PG3 V3 100k
RL5 V5 0 2.5
RL3 V3 0 3.3
RS5 V5 0 R=if(time>2.5m&time<3.5m,10m,1G)
RS3 V3 0 R=if(time>4m&time<5m,10m,1G)
.tran 0 6.5m 0 20n
.save V(V5) V(V3) I(L5) I(L3)
.end
